Z||000005||JSocha||07-20-2001||09:41 AM||||Yesterday afternoon, noticed things would load and sometimes wouldn't load.  Couldn't refresh the pages or if I clicked on a link, it would just sit there before the page could not be displayed message came up.<P>Then everything was dead!  I too was preparing to do a swan dive.  However, our tallest building or skyscraper here in ND, is an outhouse.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">  So I climbed back down thinking, if I did dive, I would just leave a mark.  On the ground and definately on my body.<P>Then I left town to see if I could sober up, took a spin in the Dodge Dually to Minot to get the AC fixed and didn't get home until about 9:30 lastnight.  I missed the PFF buzz.<P>Got on and everything was fine and got my buzz back.  However, I was so withdrawn at that time, I didn't post.  I now know I have a sever addiction.  I need help.  Does anybody know if there is a PFFA (Pennock Fiero Forum Anonymous) chapter, especially in ND that I can go to?  And if you do, do they typically serve massive quantities of coffee or beer?  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>I would like to thank as well as blame Cliff for getting me hooked on PFF and creating this lifetime addiction.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/jsocha_2.gif"> ||||reg||1
